error: `connection` was transferred and cannot be used again [E0302]

  example.bq:3:5
    3 |     send_request(connection)
      |     ------------------------
    4 |     connection.close()
      |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^  
      |       you attempted to use `connection` again here

help: If the callee only needs temporary access, pass a borrow (`ref connection`) instead.
Try:
    ref connection
